'''Castle Guard''' (剣士, Kenshi) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Castle Guard
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 214.png
|money drop = 50円 - 197円
}}

==Enemy==
A very, very pathetic enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon Collaboration]] stages. Low health, attack, slow speed, pitiful range and overall weak stats to even be considered a threat. Using anything will make quick work of this enemy.

==Strategy==
Use anything to defeat it and it will most likely die in one hit anyways.

